      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakesnwoods.com/WindomHistory.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before the railroad, early settlers hauled lumber from St. Paul to Windom, setting the stage for its growth.",
