      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakesnwoods.com/WindomHistory.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Windom sits on the banks of the historic Des Moines River, which eventually joins the Mississippi and flows to the ocean.",
